/E (3.5 TRAINING AND FINE-TUNING THE MODEL We fine-tuned the pre-trained DistilBERT model on our scraped Snapdeal review dataset. The last layer of the model was replaced to output three sentiment classes \(positive, negative, neutral\). The model was trained using a standard deep learning framework \(e.g., PyTorch or TensorFlow\) with a predefined learning rate and batch size. The dataset was split into training and validation sets to monitor performance and prevent overfitting.)
