<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This project successfully developed and implemented a sentiment analysis system for Snapdeal reviews using the DistilBERT model. We demonstrated that the model is both accurate and efficient, capable of classifying reviews into positive, negative, and neutral categories. The frontend visualization component provides a clear and actionable summary of customer sentiment, proving the system's utility for businesses.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
