388 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The current project has a few limitations. The data scraping was limited to a specific time frame and a limited number of product categories. The model, while effective, may still struggle with complex linguistic nuances like sarcasm. Additionally, the system does not perform aspect-based sentiment analysis \(e.g., distinguishing between a positive review for "battery life" and a negative one for "camera quality"\).)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
