390 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Future work could include expanding the data scraping to cover more products and a longer time period. Implementing aspect-based sentiment analysis would provide a more granular understanding of customer feedback. The system could also be enhanced to provide real-time analysis and integrate with other business intelligence tools for a more comprehensive solution.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
